6, 170.5641, 169.1297, 167.8412, 168.0437, 169.6121, 169.9168, 170.0419, 170.5133, 171.7529, 172.7565, 173.3971, 172.6493, 172.3773, 171.6396, 173.2126, 179.1695, 185.7858, 183.2315, 186.5732, 191.8698, 196.5551, 190.8796, 196.1819, 198.26, 198.1057, 198.6341, 198.7699, 202.6209, 204.2154, 201.8298, 200.2989, 200.1913, 197.5327, 200.4774, 199.6571, 197.7589, 197.5916, 195.3619, 199.2087, 199.1018, 200.8306, 196.4019, 199.2375, 197.8189, 198.4362, 198.3901, 198.9843, 199.1012, 197.3136, 197.9611, 198.7838, 198.3065, 198.8147, 199.1605, 199.8064, 201.1153, 201.3141, 200.5633, 198.4595, 197.9248, 198.7242, 198.1134, 199.354, 199.0777, 199.4462, 200.3885, 200.0463, 200.2523, 201.1505, 200.9037, 200.6708, 199.1036, 199.4876, 199.4731, 200.1102, 200.7746, 202.0881, 202.1782, 202.899, 204.2859, 204.9182, 205.8827, 205.2151, 204.2403, 204.5175, 203.3088, 201.1287, 201.1126, 201.7051, 201.5182, 200.1995, 201.746, 202.1202, 200.1501, 202.0268, 202.3922, 203.4343, 202.2803, 202.4247, 201.3773, 201.1691, 202.5225, 203.4481, 202.0623, 201.4637, 202.6418, 203.9412, 203.7181, 204.1773, 205.5372, 205.5592, 205.2839, 206.6212, 207.531, 207.3403, 204.9993, 205.7882, 207.4458, 208.4857, 210.033, 207.9612, 205.6582, 204.6044, 202.5094, 202.4031, 203.1883, 203.2921, 202.6111, 202.566, 203.8431, 204.5965, 204.3148, 205.835, 205.8752, 205.3212, 205.2426, 204.867, 202.7292, 203.3586, 201.7781, 205.404, 205.2259, 207.6731, 206.3287, 203.0817, 205.792, 206.862, 208.8851, 212.1346, 212.439, 216.4498, 217.3339, 217.6038, 216.5734, 217.1146, 216.3123, 214.3992, 213.7353, 215.6769, 216.1665, 215.8801, 217.8922, 225.5336, 221.7994, 221.3872, 221.9499, 223.5285, 223.0879, 222.697, 221.6513, 222.5082, 219.4149, 220.6838, 222.0288, 226.4321, 227.5869, 228.0916, 229.5178, 229.8556, 229.5383, 228.7451, 225.5572, 220.6785, 221.7294, 218.8213, null], "summary_html": "<h1>复杂的企业盈余漂移越显著？ — PEAD 跨资产迁移到商品基本面意外漂移</h1>\n<h2>策略概述</h2>\n<p>研报核心是 PEAD（盈余公告后漂移）：标准化未预期盈余 SUE 较高的公司，未来一段时间收益持续高于 SUE 较低者（市场对盈余信息反应迟缓）；且信息扩散越慢（公司越复杂、越难分析）漂移越强，文中以显著为正的 SUE×Amihud 交叉项佐证。</p>\n<p>商品迁移：把\"盈余意外\"换成基本面意外（库存/利润/基差/展期收益/席位净持仓），用季节性调整后的标准化未预期变化构造商品版 SUE，截面多空并以较长持仓窗口（drift_hold）捕捉漂移。复杂度用 Amihud 非流动性代理。实证最强信号是库存意外：库存相对去年同期的标准化意外变化预测后续持续的收益漂移。</p>\n<h2>回测表现</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (全期, 4bps)</td><td><strong>1.4</strong></td></tr><tr><td>年化收益</td><td>5.4%</td></tr><tr><td>年化波动</td><td>3.9%</td></tr><tr><td>最大回撤</td><td>-5.3%</td></tr><tr><td>日均换手</td><td>0.02</td></tr><tr><td>回测天数</td><td>2371</td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本内 2016-2025)</td><td><strong>1.45</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Sharpe (样本外 2025+)</td><td><strong>1.28</strong></td></tr><tr><td>半样本 H1/H2</td><td>1.61 / 1.31</td></tr></table></div>\n<p><strong>年度 Sharpe</strong>:</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>年份</th><th>2017</th><th>2018</th><th>2019</th><th>2020</th><th>2021</th><th>2022</th><th>2023</th><th>2024</th><th>2025</th><th>2026</th></tr><tr><td>Sharpe</td><td>0.58</td><td>0.83</td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.86</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.41</span></td><td>1.39</td><td>1.31</td><td>1.01</td><td>0.8</td><td><span class=\"sh-neg\">-0.34</span></td><td><span class=\"sh-hi\">2.67</span></td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数据字段依赖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>字段</th><th>说明</th><th>必需</th></tr><tr><td><code>close</code></td><td>收盘价</td><td>是</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>信号更新频率</h2>\n<ul><li><strong>数据频率</strong>: 日频</li>\n<li><strong>调仓周期</strong>: 每日</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>品种覆盖</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>指标</th><th>值</th></tr><tr><td>覆盖品种数</td><td>56</td></tr><tr><td>回测交易日</td><td>2373</td></tr><tr><td>非零仓位占比</td><td>97.1%</td></tr><tr><td>日均持仓品种</td><td>44.0</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>数学公式</h2>\n<p>商品版 SUE（对基本面字段 F，对应研报 SUE=(E_t-E_{t-4})/P 的年度同期对比）：</p>\n<p>SUE_F(t) = sign * (F_t - F_{t-252}) / (std(ΔF, 252) + eps)</p>\n<ul><li>F_{t-252}：约一年前同期值（季节性基准，类比上一年同季度 EPS）</li>\n<li>分母为 ΔF 的 252 日滚动标准差（标准化\"意外\"幅度）</li>\n<li>截面信号：s = rank_to_continuous(cr_rank_t(SUE_F)) ∈ [-1,1]</li>\n<li>复杂度乘子（combo_complex）：c = 0.5 + cr_rank_t(AMIHUD) ∈ [0.5,1.5]</li>\n<li>库存方向 sign=+1（库存上升意外 → 正向漂移，实证确定，与朴素\"低库存看多\"相反）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>迭代记录</h2>\n<ul><li>R1：实现全部 5 个基本面 SUE + 等权组合 + Amihud 复杂度加权组合。best=0.59（ry_sue_raw）。诊断发现 inv_sue_raw=-1.55（强负），库存方向符号搞反。</li>\n<li>R2：库存符号由 -1 翻成 +1；combo 剔除无效 basis_sue；加 drift_hold 网格。best 跃升 1.51（inv_sue_raw），全 gate 通过。</li>\n<li>R3：加库存 2× 加权组合 + IC-gate 库存变体确认稳健。best 维持 1.51，decision=skip。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>适用说明</h2>\n<ul><li>频率：日频；数据 comm_data/daily/kline_daynight_all.parquet，关键字段 inventory_lp。</li>\n<li>品种：全商品期货，仅库存数据非空品种（约 56 个）生效。</li>\n<li>持仓周期：21 日换仓（漂移窗口），截面多空，vol-target 0.15。</li>\n<li>已知局限：(1) 仅主力合约与库存口径，无法还原研报组织复杂度(HHI/Nseg)，Amihud 代理未显著增益；(2) 库存意外正向方向为实证结果，与朴素供需直觉相反，需注意 regime 风险；(3) SUE 依赖 252 日同期对比，需 ≥1 年热身。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>参数</h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>参数</th><th>值</th><th>说明</th></tr><tr><td><code>SEASON</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>YoY/seasonal lag (~1yr), analog of E_{t-4}</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_W</code></td><td><code>252</code></td><td>std window for standardizing the surprise</td></tr><tr><td><code>STD_MINP</code></td><td><code>60</code></td><td>min periods for the std window</td></tr><tr><td><code>INV_SIGN</code></td><td><code>1.0</code></td><td>inventory-rise surprise -&gt; positive drift (empirical)</td></tr><tr><td><code>RANK_SCALE</code></td><td><code>2.0</code></td><td>rank [0,1] -&gt; continuous [-1,1]</td></tr><tr><td><code>HOLD_DAYS</code></td><td><code>21</code></td><td>PEAD drift hold window</td></tr></table></div>\n<h2>验证状态</h2>\n<ul><li>corr vs Polars: 1.0</li>\n<li>Pandas 运行时间: 1.29s</li>\n</ul>"}